{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8a8d82802a3c9aa6d1d2e3a55d2c05f822560214ec420f7fc57e1e69afdd300c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9aeff1f6f4049de6dfa9b0849bb27f39599ed227e67483d66e55764244bb54",
      "text": "幸福的姿态",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c18c51fd92ddca902547872537d0c246cdaceba427b34afdd7de01d5bf9d4491",
      "text": "因为喜欢母亲做的瑞士卷，\n卷绪开始四处品尝其他蛋糕。\n在吃遍了附近的蛋糕后，\n他被从未闻过的蛋糕香气吸引，\n来到了Cafe Parade。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9aeff1f6f4049de6dfa9b0849bb27f39599ed227e67483d66e55764244bb54",
      "text": "幸福的姿态",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe92a8cac07f9805703f3bb9d04720e345fd599935abf620b54d7efb7b5a6ada",
      "text": "卷绪，生日快乐。\n妈妈做了蛋糕哦。尝尝看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd5f613c0132ec022e1a02221067907f49ea7e6cda3f8cd1284178d1b7948e11",
      "text": "哇啊，是瑞士卷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2d9df214fa552511bf2b3685ba9655f303e3927bb0b3b81c0c265d38f0f90e2",
      "text": "虽然形状稍微有点塌掉了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bf0e4ff88461f2a15b0f47b7da5634cc0fb232d3843085c52fd0675177f3085",
      "text": "但是，妈妈施了能让卷绪感到幸福的\n魔法哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7c99b7db5b51bef7e52c0180435b41796fd221ad9d0f943b7742fa5d6ec51cd",
      "text": "真的吗？\n我最喜欢妈妈做的蛋糕了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de341e35f958a24184c1749b15f66695a2c3725563936a97f8a6a16c7372257c",
      "text": "妈妈，谢谢你。我好幸福！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6954bb21321f23305e8ff12bb788c714e4cbec908e5c1aa2e52bedfa2c6fa393",
      "text": "卷绪能这么高兴，妈妈也很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd89cd41af243b916cd415e87e8271ef3eb3315c7d2504d0d95ee26bde046657",
      "text": "（……小时候，妈妈给我做的\n形状有点奇怪的瑞士卷）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0dec348d994d804c7c8d44d991a13ef630ee2e01ce4c696144dd19ca4687740",
      "text": "（由于家里经常搬家，\n生日派对上即使没有朋友）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e792d851c2f90a734bca6870811d52db8cbcd0a1d05f02244a2496f0f64af51",
      "text": "（只要一家人一起吃，就能感到满满的幸福）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deb902155e21ad9c0b8948192e1793ffcdc41c5cf1ca727882fa1528d83010da",
      "text": "（对我来说，蛋糕就是幸福的象征……\n所以，我想吃更多不同的蛋糕！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74c31c41d989f44f7d0d4dab25dcad7819d36536b2c491a3a28bee4f06117aeb",
      "text": "今天也要去寻找美味的蛋糕啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8bdab38abff4165fdbc34d098522fb635ad5b27729b0d4871021ff0df11ea9",
      "text": "谢谢惠顾！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:088fb6850e7b0d4b290c1e80da28b3107b8f95e3ddb6aa201818c267b74e7b1a",
      "text": "承蒙款待！\n呵呵，这里的蛋糕也超级好吃啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5e644cb1bd2eb1b5ebbc719d96acb6a0e079c20698c8f8665339339255f1622",
      "text": "可是……哈啊～～……怎么办啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06f9d36f7946cf1e4762964ca01271689bb7d0f96244531a70de9b70076a6861",
      "text": "这一带的蛋糕今天全被我吃遍了……\n以后，该带着什么期盼活下去啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:998ae0176332896f2d591e274fd4002d4a01756c60644184f87208d9779af506",
      "text": "……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f3245d0e742149113e93587eecbc6c21bfdfc8bc1232d339ba999fdcb36f2fd",
      "text": "（这是……从未闻过的蛋糕香气！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f27cc59da4786174f0c09647160cd952a65e3162ce9a8d9ca32833b411be2704",
      "text": "香气是……从这边来的吗……啊！找到了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:945bebf69580ddfeba24c4a44ef918628cfa313e2e00cb34b77b1da8edb23807",
      "text": "（这种地方居然有这么时尚的咖啡馆……！\n平时不怎么来这一带所以完全没注意到）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a233a6d5658feaa935da77b63bdbf9025a9fc0c482059d3c0e8ff3e17a5b5869",
      "text": "（果然，蛋糕的香气也是从这里传出来的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_b:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf3dce7e0054032b565b0e9dc6a10863882f265db3ff84f615ec394b2803bf2",
      "text": "这里有，全新的蛋糕……！？\n吸——呼——……好，马上进去看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:552622cdd5a68ed843eb09a842da98543fd92bb9f7e219e621d9e35e737bdf5d",
      "text": "欢迎光临。欢迎来到Cafe Parade！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b6c74eb27d23d17755b54bc9f949706966e4f2cdb46e5f2b245c2d2280fb918",
      "text": "（哇啊，店里也好时尚啊……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9b587a31a4201e4190d154ca7b8c3c1ca99c2aac66da54052c40718213f64cf",
      "text": "请坐这边。\n这是菜单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec9ecd8c7d51bbb2efec3b4213f0e142cd92d2251b6282c6ed34586abcbc0fc1",
      "text": "决定好点单后，请随时叫我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9bc03f4ae950e637fd94700ce0c41a13254195044fbd79d60112a3148681823",
      "text": "好的。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a52dafff4f7a9151d379b6ebea51d85f23c3b8d4421631b7f730cd8b48360e13",
      "text": "（……看起来都好好吃！这种时候……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da3ad4a1b3e589097c79589dd8358a90fadadc287048679aff38edca1e026800",
      "text": "不好意思。这份菜单上写的所有蛋糕，\n我可以全点一遍吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ac7503f53f71d6ce3d40ca5418d47b43c2a15f55c85795f03e97ac447935782",
      "text": "好的，当然可以。\n种类相当多，没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4db923a9bae8c37aab78cddab450e3aa4cd8fa01621da3e01712d389cdeebd2d",
      "text": "没问题！因为我最喜欢蛋糕了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_c:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf5b47ef8cfd81247bea1bc4919cba123166ee0df23080c7ed171e806ae99435",
      "text": "（呵呵，好期待啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334abdc79c88c868c5ee4f6c136c0bd33cb3c6d2c84e7ff198176d8d2dce44ed",
      "text": "………………\n呜呜……太美妙了……！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff630815804af93053b4b84e30c38f6d1756a4d99a09905e973aa9654e63172",
      "text": "顺应季节搭配的水果，\n配料的挑选自不必说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:133ab79e3f4b24c91f4fedfb3807d1719caecabb318750e23064bd202de735bc",
      "text": "润物细无声般静静蔓延的甘甜，\n以及随之绽放的清爽风味！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ee10203fb48e4f61086ce6f259c1d04e4e1dc8e03fcfade415eced73c7da82e",
      "text": "也就是说……这里的蛋糕是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64cda88a225b9154286cf4039b905d4c2abbac194cfd550e762e06bff3bf5f3e",
      "text": "客人，红茶需要续杯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaa7874cca988a5ba0a95cdaf2414cc9fdf3c8d356136c5c59163b59f23a0b32",
      "text": "这里的蛋糕，每一款都超级好吃！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:562df58813d46b1c285ee1897c15a2d64128dc6a1b247551cf0bb4988c7979e9",
      "text": "我至今吃过形形色色的蛋糕，\n甚至还做成了剪贴簿……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b6777cb233d17ec175f314cb30afa6cef9451295ecc2a0162436ac516e9481f",
      "text": "哦哦，这可真厉害……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:812b97fa18f03e36ceffe2c005052bacc475c621c8a2ba8ffa02697ddeaec248",
      "text": "但是，这里的蛋糕是第一名！\n这里的西点师是天才！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a5559462495a870e73bcce891136cd3cf6159b71dced5e4b8bd2119302a1aee",
      "text": "那真是太感谢了。\n制作者本人也会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88a547c99381ed5dd30db8d32c7142794dbb30eda7c8e48f0bac363a24153242",
      "text": "所以，请务必让我见一见那位西点师！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65bed32b13f783b17ebebdcec6cd64ad05ac945419462a85fe74dfd29c106d4a",
      "text": "我想把这份感动，直接传达给他！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000116:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcf4e0385142c7a51179da56e22aead73f8708476a212da02b7e9da1ba971019",
      "text": "Cafe Parade 后厨",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5910eb0eb1680a7bbcd6b3ae72600a98bfd66d324d9566369539f312e264b7d7",
      "text": "……事情就是这样，\n对方说想直接向你传达对蛋糕的感想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08ec1990dc8b7b9e2f803a040d080df54b3bafa48cdc8fa189a7982373534e51",
      "text": "唉……客人喜欢固然值得高兴，\n但我可不想被卷进麻烦事里啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05808a137ac561ae1bf00296ad679e08f70e50c6cf73e04f577e755752bc5f78",
      "text": "好了好了，难得人家这么热情，\n偶尔这样一次不也挺好的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_d:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:098bbee21c35c6dba9e5d2e4ba2f848605a1c581b80d1e245e43522ebb779668",
      "text": "真是的……拿你没办法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08d60cf7fed0e8443374ea3b06e3ef8e6e002fc64df80c539c8a0b8626e97b5f",
      "text": "我是西点师东云庄一郎。\n承蒙夸奖，深感荣幸。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a6f9f23e3dbb6c5580b467e838e86b0374f585314507186e48247108528d9f6",
      "text": "您就是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:556db16f65b028da82ae20647d07e80b9cc290ebee5c0ed0c75d7f30cca6e260",
      "text": "那、那个……\n这里的蛋糕，真的每一款都太美味了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afe6c56541052ae4a5a7a1b4c36beec22a7af26395ca1d717c280b0117c7b17c",
      "text": "每一款都有着艺术般的风味，与同样艺术般的外观\n交织成绝妙的和弦……太让我感动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed43b1100c1a28b2fc852d3997c3b320aceff442a1ee9b2b5ab337a87591c424",
      "text": "我一定会再来的！做出这样一家店和\n这些蛋糕，真的太感谢您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc4723c90c9e27416e451063df50036ea4dff1b209d824efb9897cf1ff5352e7",
      "text": "好的。期待您的再次光临。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9279884c47fed3b219add5f289973f3239d2bc5d9d494de6f1b5bc1a19292e7d",
      "text": "（呼……虽然看得出非常喜欢蛋糕，\n但这势头也太猛了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:433c0bf4206fa6ea262c855574746d2e8d2ab13d272e0023203d30cdfc3a9ddb",
      "text": "唔，怎么了？庄一郎。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6cdcd50b4dfda83dbd44939d00d66eec1c2e6966949eed4a3f825df5c54cfab",
      "text": "……呵，没什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be1679c9f182c2b8cdf3ebe4d8540a88c92dec35d975dba0b49b8056426dedfb",
      "text": "只是觉得最近身边聚集过来的，\n尽是些富有热情的人呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50cd88f8672b8cc814e90b3d0967d60f43cddf80b6a0ee737b50b89787252556",
      "text": "（自那之后来了好多次……\n这里的蛋糕果然是最棒的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d88d8b3a4bb5537543d760ed0e851d25f922e64e7f314ea3f23dcfef58d8a12",
      "text": "（无论吃多少次都不会腻，\n不仅如此，每次品尝都能有新的发现）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6077685938b14c21609bf29b21410400d55f064dfbcb3ca09ecb3e3653376aa",
      "text": "（最近越来越有名气，\n来这里的客人也增加了。但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e381bc26df4e4d311e55b3d9de4b1f1e6b69c5ca5b318e91dc344383fb1b2ba3",
      "text": "欢迎光临。请问几位？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8409ccdb67db7bd06f97a4128c1fb9002e3b58e3512b510541f67b1de6105799",
      "text": "这是本店推荐的草莓鲜奶油蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0786b1fe2880f202f3b0e66a0a409713c6638982b47f3c535f2eccde16749f4e",
      "text": "（两个人都看起来好忙啊。\n身为西点师的庄一郎先生也跑出来做侍应了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:556c1b1c066ddc4cdd7db4a8d43bec2f30f5e9c43fc8e163083b2203e5181aa7",
      "text": "（如果可以的话，真希望庄一郎先生\n能专心做蛋糕啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b38fed95cd6466ea58874c86137cde81e3bf0b6372fbb9ae38209c2d8502bed",
      "text": "你好，店长。\n今天看起来也非常忙呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3b77c4b61a1055cfb76d3092c6072a352f3f48f30b5a308727bd8734b13527c",
      "text": "是啊，承蒙关照。只是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaaed1279541eaff66d9250301ce53ec01d976cef665b1e33a59f1ed9abfae79",
      "text": "如果能有大堂店员的话，\n情况就会大不一样了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06ee370896e69c128a6d4c03afcaaf7cdb32ff588a8192e791c56e1989e4d556",
      "text": "大堂店员……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acc10f0b41975009ff9b0c949fb1c17af112ef8f42ff2194913e8cf1e31c07b0",
      "text": "（难道说，如果我去当大堂店员，\n庄一郎先生就能集中精力做蛋糕了吗！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_f:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:895bfdd3ca9486b81e19cd8e6b1df8613b0195861229e3eb9753ffabad7cf345",
      "text": "（而且，我也能……\n在近旁感受最棒的蛋糕了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:146c5bec34d5e7758cc88fc1cd0a4c522254c57184f739f36e006c4deaee18c4",
      "text": "打烊后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77827539d623fb86037bd06613989653317cb086c408fdb148be0aa8aa25183f",
      "text": "那个，打扰了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:954860567549741c160ca097dc59ebc925d917175efa4251500e1b9830daef4b",
      "text": "哎呀，你是……落了什么东西吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44218352eddee928837b4d35f11907eca0d0e37ea1a2cb4390878cee6085c370",
      "text": "不是的，那个……能让我在这里……\n在Cafe Parade打工吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbafb4f458e949584299bbb229cbaf8b9c3cc32c024885f4f882021fd2f48fc2",
      "text": "我最喜欢这家店了。\n所以，我想助大家一臂之力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b4d1818a0713e40c3fb55e3cd2f0a87e85d6bb95aa4c925aa6ff882baf319a5",
      "text": "拜托了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76c010b102a8da78e4b5164a2cc41be05a2dcdfc41769cea9a552194ba2f502c",
      "text": "……太突然了，吓了我一跳呢。\n不过，你能这么说我很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a78fc9902e2a4e14ecba45fb5f4cf151adb228d51485421e277fa114a0f07bc",
      "text": "当然非常欢迎啦！东云你觉得呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:086d8aacc37a82359a49615d8b569ec4089bb01f259e6f4934d599a7041e80d5",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a70e400c36f6e486b54d932b8784123d83266b5f45c59f374819f72981cd718",
      "text": "（对蛋糕的那种亢奋情绪虽然让人有些担忧……\n但与此同时，这份热情和相关知识是货真价实的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20f7314aca4e2b6542194b9cf690f477c57574b8a0eb612dcbdb2f326953cf47",
      "text": "（……应该会成为可靠的大堂店员吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55fbfb9325f8974195531ef14ee60b8fbf422b2142678caa0e31b8c4b54d684b",
      "text": "好的。我也赞成。\n今后就请多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_g:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7fe984b1662d37ad809c84e0bc4951366470c9602746ccf76ad8f8581908bce",
      "text": "好、好的。请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15be88406f0baa5efa53a071de940d115419752c48c96dfeb0129d92acb78b0f",
      "text": "（呼……终于放学了啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:729f5eb6507fc2bb298e7702ca9f4b5c355977f691f428dd3be73c73dea5f2dc",
      "text": "（今天发售的新款彩妆，得趁着还没卖光\n赶快去买才行！……不过，在那之前）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79df98324fe45c5798f7216970b25cfc951698988db20cae85cf20e393f21fa6",
      "text": "（……嗯。洗手间里也没人）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4d27da85faae9c66248abc7aea480f1daabba6b463d6bef8e4a881ca611bd33",
      "text": "赶快换衣服吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:500a66540f2b83d81da5bbe1acd15ab961634175e5b957d3cd815fe5daa5e186",
      "text": "（……在杂志上一见钟情的，那支唇膏。\n颜色和包装都超级可爱的呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6df9182724b932d99016f0a0856dfb3f9a70f952b24630b8619162eedc43622d",
      "text": "（去店里试色好期待呀。\n涂上会变成什么样呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a228549d190e914dc549180148b2dd43fe932d44fa4e75264e7799d4655c6133",
      "text": "（……好啦！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdd332d63d230cbf1a641edca2b8bc01b54c22e40c1004826f886d06ba1d62bb",
      "text": "（裙子的长度……嗯，完美。\n发型和妆容感觉都很棒！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72360bad7f2311c6a90057bb26401d330005562e6a9891f723155929a26aaae1",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿，今天也是满分☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2024a0b9a3d6cac6b0762dbb765bfe46fd0d33265ea5b1779b7ae3e71c07fad9",
      "text": "（果然……这个模样的我，最喜欢了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e20e040aa423a97c78f4c4e96d000497931f38459dec77b140ae4da8865e63c",
      "text": "准备OK♪\n去逛街购物，啪噼地GO GO！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b61cc3b1f77a56b9822df8387bdd1eed6ea95cf2a05bd1f4c9017629bdd577b",
      "text": "购物中心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfabaaf34a77179da0a78d3327eaba3310bc19ab1f116659a6bd38bd46da9375",
      "text": "哇啊，这条裙子也好可爱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34365ec76b3af50b8550f527ebc56751613ca068de755ff1aba8284fd518ed0e",
      "text": "嗯——难得来一次，干脆一起买了吧……\n店员，这件我也要了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e5e23a4df32b2cc898120fa9c2ef09502a58c738940e5c8ac25ede3ee3c81a2",
      "text": "谢谢惠顾！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0087e3727cc46ec9c36811a3aac01f58d69d7190b8e3fdd3121b782575ac2a04",
      "text": "（既买到了新款唇膏，\n又发现好多可爱的衣服……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cd4a5e2f2507794bee85f3631e5669a3485f9142f9269dcbe12feb5dbd9aae4",
      "text": "真的可以说是拿满分的感觉呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0223b7a3f4a1da2da1f087396930f699a87b40f6b471c6c590d3ee854988c9a",
      "text": "不过，走得有点累了呢。\n去那边的长椅休息一下吧～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b84ca0d8ccb03185622c66b366f67f76bbc4abc995c4b1c58848da729c998ca4",
      "text": "（今天买的这些，每一件\n都让人等不及想穿上了呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71c53c52a3164e3357dcfeda4858181912041bfd3c0f87d608b048ccf7a6a274",
      "text": "喂喂，看到那边的新款裙子了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:465e7eaddf8380d01bb954ecdaf78679d96555c2e0f3c16d806671b8c6bfd73b",
      "text": "（啊……是同班同学）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c5d2948cd37de4e436d29951f60f4c1eaa35379bf7024ac0db367cddca20821",
      "text": "超级可爱的对吧！\n我一眼就看中了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb8e7dcfbdfbd8b5deda59e21bbd69efdb5475a0a0b9590e1edaaef795534d7f",
      "text": "（真好啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f33cdbd3529d45dd2361d7a7621be0d02774953db8540f15f818a97f2d01f675",
      "text": "（一个人来虽然也不错，但也想试试那样，\n和朋友一起开开心心地逛街购物啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12bf3d4a626ea4e4d8102acf2b9027702c9235e8604412ea3c63480b4e322ca2",
      "text": "（不过，对我来说肯定……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_i:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b6e928f9275479375c0fce9ec3826a061ec1f87e43eed6b5ed97c0127d6b6c8",
      "text": "……差不多该回家啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:404409cc713612e6442499f52a9972a3fb66625ac026867de7c31b61c408da47",
      "text": "……啊，对了。回家之前，\n得找个地方把衣服和妆容换回那边才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4221f5c8da3fe4bc790265d7f31fa603b856d560921a678d4728e68561a03455",
      "text": "（要是被爸爸看到这身打扮，\n肯定又要挨骂了。说什么一点都不像个男孩子……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d30af87889ee96fb261c1c2115ad846dbfb70d7e2b51d9e9b2428dffa133841e",
      "text": "诶？……哇！\n雨下得好大。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b5f58bfd424af9cb2c8ebbb56238f62a9d24364ad21f6f0077ba95b1df94f8a",
      "text": "这样下去要感冒了。\n总之先去那边避避雨吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000070:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1f54d30cc98a53c719a070d3ae169d119380f46cf93400ab08f2ab7331b068",
      "text": "高架桥下",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a62b175ba7e29173d920bc9d7766745e20f22d860485f0ede8a7a6954173757b",
      "text": "呼，这样就没事了……咦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f76c5ae0186d77f02a670c7ff88adc6d903f06c5250118cbfd224283fd93d10c",
      "text": "那边的纸箱里，是不是有什么东西……？\n……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f36aa99838ccdcf6af66ca7ee80fdd5d3cd691a88c97bc47542c050ce41dbf32",
      "text": "哇哇，是小香猪！\n怎么会在这种地方！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000106:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ade1ecca688f7a3e80fd933dbdad3af776ef48e905c9b788bd8977880554e91",
      "text": "（难道是，被遗弃了吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34041ae112dc3c05e69c724562d3aa918d8cdd03e90ef8a16aaf755a8e4a2b49",
      "text": "这样啊……你也是孤零零一个人呢。\n一起避避雨吧。来，到这里来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000130:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea5e9618b91d99ca6d05e847abcea844e86462db6c1b5c0aeb67fffc2603599",
      "text": "……\n雨完全没有要停的意思呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b9adae5794263fee7603e5449a9335b10d74173aa478b3373ea560d04da81f0",
      "text": "（不过，如果不用回家的话……\n我就能一直保持这个模样了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45c873af00a4e0a4f8b3bf9501b93c80cc7d13afc0948e29614b561000fbd1f3",
      "text": "（虽然这种愿望根本不可能实现就是了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bafe01362a33d05f050b0778f6ea2bcddece87f94eddbfd56c15d265a4fbbc8d",
      "text": "你没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c",
      "text": "诶？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_02_1_1_010_02:1_1_010_02_j:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c80fee7a5c8894604dff5cf58e5088d312f6b8fa627fa0765268b31e72db4ca",
      "text": "在这种地方怎么了吗？\n女孩子受凉了可不行哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
